00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.500
Perhaps this vice-masher has already warned the Americans about the mask.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:13.640
That is possible.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:17.450
So I'm leaving immediately after the execution to report the danger to the mask himself.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:39.380
No!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:23.730
Friend you are in great danger. I realize that some of your men shot too close to me. I thought I was here

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:28.580
If I had issued blank and munitions, but I would have noticed that no bullets hit the wall

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:36.640
smart did you arrange my passage to america yes you will be smuggled into lisbon and then you can

