Alan!

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:41.130
Well, I thought you were killing that plane crash from France a year ago.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.010
So did everyone.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.840
Even the news service I reported for.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:47.240
That's why I became Spice Masher,

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.140
so I could fight the Nazis on their own ground.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:52.400
Now it's time to fight them here, in the United States.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.330
Well, that man who mistook me for you,

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:55.840
were you trailing him?

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:56.740
Yeah.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.800
He was headed to the Gestapo in Paris.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:07:59.970
What was he doing?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.420
here i don't know do you know anything about him oh i never saw him before he came in and asked the

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:09.640
porter what time we arrived at lakeside junction there's nothing of any military importance at

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:16.760
lakeside junction is there no only that's where i'm going to visit my fiancee oh so you're engaged

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:22.540
now yes he's a swell girl alan she's the daughter of admiral corby who's admiral corby he's a

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:28.250
retired naval officer that was recently appointed commissioner of the naval intelligence bizarre

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.010
We're going there.

