We've got to warn Corby at the next station.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.140
We can't do that.

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:36.050
Kenny, we're driving down from Washington.

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.090
I have no idea where they'll spend the night.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.040
