00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:41.120
Yes.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:42.060
Yes, there is.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:42.780
Well, grab your luggage.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.960
We're going to charter a plane there and find it at Corby Estate.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.600
Oh, someone just came into the drive.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:03.850
Were you expecting someone, Dad?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.060
Why, no, dear.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.590
Oh, will you see who it is, David?

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:17.420
Let me do the toilet.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.100
Something's wrong down there.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.180
Take the stick.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.020
