00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.160
What's the meaning of this?

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:48.930
Just a minute.

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:51.670
Open that safe.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.700
I'll do nothing of the sort.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:54.880
Nice going, Dad.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.180
Shall I work him over?

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.180
No.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:00.980
Not him.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:03.360
I'll open it.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:39.560
What's wrong out there? See what it is.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:47.320
High measure.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.440
Hi, Jack, we didn't expect you back for hours.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:06.050
Well, I came down by plane and took a taxi from the airport.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.870
Just as I was arriving, I saw what appeared to be a holdup.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.180
One of the men dropped this.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.350
Oh, my papers.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:14.570
Something they stole from you, Admiral?

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:18.700
Yes, a new mine chart, Shark Bay.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:22.330
For your own protection and eaves,

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.660
