00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:27.770
Now, if you could loan me one of your cards,

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.210
I'd like to go to my apartment address.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:29.980
Oh, I...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.320
Certainly.

