00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:56.330
The mask is trying to flood the United States with counterfeit money.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.300
Shark Bay is an ideal spot to smuggle it ashore.

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:01.850
Do you think he'll attempt it again?

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.320
I don't know. It's unlikely.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:08.080
Unless the upset of Corby's came too late for him to change his plans.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.360
We can't take any chances.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.720
We've got to be in Shark Bay tonight.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:12.440
Come on.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:23.540
Stay there as she goes.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.460
